ubItem><SubItem><Name>sFileName</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ File name ]]></Comment><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>728</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>sFileSuffix</Name><Type>STRING(80)</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Suffix of file ]]></Comment><BitSize>648</BitSize><BitOffs>1376</BitOffs><Default><String>dat</String></Default><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>dwOpenMode</Name><Type>DWORD</Type><Comment><![CDATA[
															FOPEN_MODEREAD (16#0001)	"r": Opens for reading. If the file does not exist or cannot be found, the call fails.
															FOPEN_MODEWRITE (16#0002) "w": Opens an empty file for writing. If the given file exists, its contents are destroyed.
															FOPEN_MODEAPPEND (16#0004) "a": Opens for writing at the end of the file (appending) without removing the EOF marker before writing new data to the file; creates the file first if it doesn’t exist.
															FOPEN_MODEREAD OR FOPEN_MODEPLUS (16#0008) "r+": Opens for reading and writing. The file must exist.
															FOPEN_MODEWRITE OR FOPEN_MODEPLUS (16#0008) "w+": Opens an empty file for both reading and writing. If the given file exists, its contents are destroyed.
															FOPEN_MODEAPPEND OR FOPEN_MODEPLUS (16#0008)	 "a+": Opens for reading and appending; the appending operation includes the removal of the EOF marker before new data is written to the file and the EOF marker is restored after writing is complete; creates the file first if it doesn’t exist.
															When a file is opened with the "a" or "a+" access type, all write operations occur at the end of the file. The file pointer can be repositioned using FB_FileSeek, but is always moved back to the end of the file before any write operation is carried out. Thus, existing data cannot be overwritten.
															
															FOPEN_MODEBINARY (16#0010) "b": Open in binary (untranslated) mode.
															FOPEN_MODETEXT (16#0020) "t": Open in text (translated) mode.
														]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>2048</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>sWriteRecord</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_System">T_MaxString</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Record to write ]]></Comment><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>2080</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>tTimeout</Name><Type>TIME</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ States the time before the function is cancelled ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>4128</BitOffs><Default><DateTime>t#1s</DateTime></Default><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>sReadRecord</Name><Type Namespace="Tc2_System">T_MaxString</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Record to read ]]></Comment><BitSize>2048</BitSize><BitOffs>4160</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bBusy</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Program busy ]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>6208</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bDone</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Program done ]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>6216</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bError</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Program error ]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>6224</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>udnErrNo</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Error number ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>6240</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>enStep</Name><Type>Implicit_Enum__